@host = http://localhost:5130
# Under compose this port is NOT published - run the service bare-metal (dotnet run) to use this file.

### The internal snapshot door - called DIRECT at the service; the gateway has no /internal route
### Expect 200 OK - a fresh customer simply gets an empty lines list; the CALLER decides what empty means
GET {{host}}/internal/baskets/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### The internal clear door - checkout's second step; expect 204 No Content (safe to repeat)
DELETE {{host}}/internal/baskets/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
